        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angoon%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1973, Angoon secured a $90,000 settlement from the U.S. government for the 1882 bombardment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
